## 4. Provider Router 구현

`src/providers/ProviderRouter.ts`

```ts
import { Provider, ProviderType } from './Provider';

export class ProviderRouter {
  private readonly providerMap: Map<ProviderType, Provider>;

  constructor(providers: Provider[]) {
    this.providerMap = new Map();

    for (const provider of providers) {
      if (this.providerMap.has(provider.type)) {
        throw new Error(`Duplicate provider registered: ${provider.type}`);
      }
      this.providerMap.set(provider.type, provider);
    }
  }

  getProvider(type: ProviderType): Provider {
    const provider = this.providerMap.get(type);

    if (!provider) {
      throw new Error(`Provider not found for type: ${type}`);
    }

    return provider;
  }
}
```

이 구조의 장점은:

- provider 추가가 쉬움
- router는 provider 선택만 담당
- 서비스는 구체 구현체를 몰라도 됨

---

## 5. 서비스 레이어

`src/services/NotificationService.ts`

```ts
import { ProviderRouter } from '../providers/ProviderRouter';
import { ProviderType, SendMessageInput, SendMessageResult } from '../providers/Provider';

export class NotificationService {
  constructor(private readonly providerRouter: ProviderRouter) {}

  async send(providerType: ProviderType, input: SendMessageInput): Promise<SendMessageResult> {
    const provider = this.providerRouter.getProvider(providerType);
    return provider.send(input);
  }
}
```

---

## 6. 실행 예시

`src/index.ts`

```ts
import { EmailProvider } from './providers/EmailProvider';
import { SmsProvider } from './providers/SmsProvider';
import { PushProvider } from './providers/PushProvider';
import { ProviderRouter } from './providers/ProviderRouter';
import { NotificationService } from './services/NotificationService';

async function main() {
  const router = new ProviderRouter([
    new EmailProvider(),
    new SmsProvider(),
    new PushProvider(),
  ]);

  const notificationService = new NotificationService(router);

  const emailResult = await notificationService.send('email', {
    to: 'user@example.com',
    subject: 'Welcome',
    content: 'Hello from email provider',
  });

  console.log('emailResult:', emailResult);

  const smsResult = await notificationService.send('sms', {
    to: '01012345678',
    content: 'Hello from sms provider',
  });

  console.log('smsResult:', smsResult);

  const pushResult = await notificationService.send('push', {
    to: 'device-token-123',
    content: 'Hello from push provider',
  });

  console.log('pushResult:', pushResult);
}

main().catch((err) => {
  console.error(err);
  process.exit(1);
});
```

