## 설계 개요

### 평가 흐름
1. 각 provider가 응답을 반환
2. 응답을 `ProviderResponse` 형태로 정규화
3. `ScoreRule[]`를 순회하며 provider별 점수 계산
4. 총점 집계
5. tie-breaker로 winner 결정
6. 결과를 `ScoreboardResult`로 반환

### 예시 평가 기준
- 응답 성공 여부
- latency
- 가격(cost)
- 응답 길이/품질에 대한 휴리스틱
- JSON schema 유효성
- 필수 키워드 포함 여부

---

# 1) 타입 정의

```ts
// scoreboard.ts

export type ProviderName = string;

export interface ProviderResponse<T = unknown> {
  provider: ProviderName;
  success: boolean;
  latencyMs: number;
  costUsd?: number;
  output?: T;
  rawText?: string;
  error?: string;
  metadata?: Record<string, unknown>;
}

export interface ScoreContext {
  startedAt: number;
  finishedAt: number;
  requestId?: string;
  expectedKeywords?: string[];
  schemaValidator?: (value: unknown) => boolean;
}

export interface ScoreRule {
  name: string;
  weight: number;
  score: (response: ProviderResponse, context: ScoreContext) => number;
  maxScore?: number;
  minScore?: number;
  description?: string;
}

export interface RuleScore {
  ruleName: string;
  weight: number;
  rawScore: number;
  weightedScore: number;
  description?: string;
}

export interface ProviderScorecard {
  provider: ProviderName;
  totalRawScore: number;
  totalWeightedScore: number;
  success: boolean;
  latencyMs: number;
  costUsd?: number;
  output?: unknown;
  error?: string;
  ruleScores: RuleScore[];
  rank?: number;
}

export interface ScoreboardResult {
  winner: ProviderScorecard | null;
  rankings: ProviderScorecard[];
  context: ScoreContext;
}
```

